    "title": "Roughtime",
    "abstract": "   This document describes Roughtime, an experimental protocol that aims\n   to achieve two things: secure rough time synchronization even for\n   clients without any idea of what time it is, and give clients a\n   format for reporting any inconsistencies they observe between\n   timeservers.  This document specifies the on-wire protocol required\n   for these goals, and discusses aspects of the ecosystem needed for it\n   to work.\n",
